  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">23-0002150_CONSULTATION FOR ORGANISATIONAL RISK AND INTEGRITY ASSESSMENT (ORIA) de Tanager dans le cadre du carrefour des opportunites pour les jeunes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">23-0002150_EKN-OUA would like to support Tanager regarding the development of a new activity: &quot;Carrefour des Opportunites pour les j eunes&quot;. Before providing support, an assessment of the institutional and organisational capacity of TANAGER is needed. This activity is to r ecruit an independent consultant to conduct an ORIA of the planed partner. The aim is to analysis TANAGER&#x2019;s capacity to administer international cooperation funds and carry out other tasks, and of any strengths and weaknesses that the organisation may have and any risks that it may run. This analysis will be used to determine whether the Tanager is capable to implement the activity in an effective way. Measures to mitigate significant risks identified in the analysis could be included as conditions in the agreement between TANAGER and to Embassy in Ouagadougou.</narrative>
  </description>
